{"id": "unknown-2026-10-17-005", "date": "2026-10-17", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "France to ease grid connection rules for solar-plus-storage projects up to 25 MW", "content": "<p>France plans to ease grid connection rules for solar-plus-storage projects with installed capacity of up to 25 MW, provided grid injection does not exceed 17 MW. The measure is part of a broader government initiative to accelerate electrification and improve electricity demand flexibility.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/17/france-to-ease-grid-connection-rules-for-solar-plus-storage-projects-up-to-25-mw/\">France to ease grid connection rules for solar-plus-storage", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/17/france-to-ease-grid-connection-rules-for-solar-plus-storage-projects-up-to-25-mw/", "type": "rss"}]}
